Still 1.2.0. Fixes the connect failure in build 154.

With tap-to-capture on, connecting reported "channel count must be at least 1" and gave up. The listening state has no microphone by design, but the engine was told that one statement too late — it had already opened the devices and asked for an input that was not there.

Also in this build: the tap threshold measured from your recordings, 12 dB to 30, with the pulse and gap windows widened to match.
